---

<section class="site-section" id="core-values">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="section-heading">Core Values</h1>
    <p class="section-description">
      Here are three of my core values. I've listed a few ways in which a work
      environment can help me prioritise them.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
        <h4 class="sub-heading">Invest in<br />Family</h4>
        <ul class="value-list">
          <li>Supports Work / Life Balance</li>
          <li>Promotes Honesty</li>
          <li>Encourages Healthy Living</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
        <h4 class="sub-heading">Explore<br />Curiosity</h4>
        <ul class="value-list">
          <li>Gives Freedom to Learn</li>
          <li>Inspires Innovation</li>
          <li>Allows for Creativity</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
        <h4 class="sub-heading">Lead<br />Proactively</h4>
        <ul class="value-list">
          <li>Expects Excellence</li>
          <li>Gives Ownership</li>
          <li>Provides Clear Vision</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .value-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .value-list li {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.875rem 0;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
</style>
